{%- doc -%}
  Materia Themes. Sample photos for the Try the Look section: a real model
  (background removed, cropped at the feet) or one of the pieces he wears, shown until a Look has its own model picture and products. The
  merchant's own picture and products always replace them.

  Photo credits (Storelib, round 26: streetwear looks). Unsplash photographs
  (Unsplash License, https://unsplash.com/license), background removed by
  machine (BiRefNet) and cropped at the feet; the piece thumbnails are crops of
  the same photographs. Logos on look 2's tee, shorts and trainers are painted out.
    1. Graffiti zip hoodie and sweatpants, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1732475530155-90158f3b5f79
       assets/ttl-sample-model-1.webp, ttl-sample-piece-1-1..3.webp
    2. Black tee and nylon shorts, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1763750581767-b367bcd6c117
       assets/ttl-sample-model-2.webp, ttl-sample-piece-2-1..3.webp
    3. Washed black tee and wide denim, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1768696082704-c4e5593d9f27
       assets/ttl-sample-model-3.webp, ttl-sample-piece-3-1..3.webp
    4. Boxy black tee and cargo pants, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789938581278-4a28ff217f9c
       assets/ttl-sample-model-4.webp, ttl-sample-piece-4-1..3.webp

  @param {number} index - Which sample look (0-3; larger numbers wrap round)
  @param {string} [part] - 'model' (default) or 'piece'
  @param {number} [piece] - For part 'piece': which piece of the look (1-3)

  @example
  {% render 'try-the-look-sample', index: 0 %}
  {% render 'try-the-look-sample', index: 2, part: 'piece', piece: 1 %}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  assign k = index | modulo: 4
  assign i = k | plus: 1
  assign widths = '310,369,289,352' | split: ','
  assign w = widths[k]
-%}
{%- if part == 'piece' -%}
  {%- assign file = 'ttl-sample-piece-' | append: i | append: '-' | append: piece | append: '.webp' -%}
  <img class="ttl__sample-img" src="{{ file | asset_url }}" width="320" height="320" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign file = 'ttl-sample-model-' | append: i | append: '.webp' -%}
  <img class="ttl__sample-img" src="{{ file | asset_url }}" width="{{ w }}" height="1000" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" draggable="false">
{%- endif -%}
